        "original_id": "4013bc9c-1aef-5c79-af7b-5982f72c1a2c",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Thomas Rickman, Sissy Spacek, Loretta Lynn, Tommy Lee Jones, Martha Plimpton\n- Works: Coal Miner's Daughter, Hooper, Tuesdays with Morrie, Truman, The River Rat\n- Roles: film director, screenwriter, actress\n- Awards: Academy Award for Best Actress\n\nFacts:\n- Thomas Rickman, sometimes credited as Tom Rickman, is an American film director and screenwriter.\n- Thomas Rickman is known for the films Coal Miner's Daughter, Hooper, Tuesdays with Morrie, and Truman.\n- In 1980, Coal Miner's Daughter starred Sissy Spacek as Loretta Lynn.\n- Sissy Spacek won the Academy Award for Best Actress for her role as Loretta Lynn in Coal Miner's Daughter.\n- In 1984, The River Rat was released as an independent family film.\n- The River Rat was directed by Thomas Rickman.\n- The River Rat starred Tommy Lee Jones and Martha Plimpton.",
